[0.000, "o", "\u001b[6;19H┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\u001b[7;19H│\u001b[62C│\u001b[8;19H│\u001b[15C\u001b[93m\u001b[1m* * * THE WIZARD'S CASTLE * * *\u001b[16C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[9;19H│\u001b[62C│\u001b[10;19H│\u001b[5C\u001b[1mMany cycles ago, in the Kingdom of N'DIC, the gnomic\u001b[5C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[11;19H│\u001b[5C\u001b[1mwizard ZOT forged his great *ORB OF POWER*. He soon\u001b[6C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[12;19H│\u001b[4C\u001b[1mvanished, leaving behind his vast subterranean castle\u001b[5C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[13;19H│\u001b[4C\u001b[1mfilled with esurient monsters, fabulous treasures, and\u001b[4C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[14;19H│\u001b[3C\u001b[1mthe incredible *ORB OF ZOT*. From that time hence, many\u001b[4C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[15;19H│\u001b[4C\u001b[1ma bold youth has ventured into the wizard's castle. As\u001b[4C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[16;19H│\u001b[4C\u001b[1mof now, *NONE* has ever emerged victoriously! BEWARE!!\u001b[4C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[17;19H│\u001b[62C│\u001b[18;19H│\u001b[24C\u001b[7m Press\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[7m any key \u001b[23C\u001b(B\u001b[m│\u001b[19;19H│\u001b[62C│\u001b[20;19H└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[?25l"]
